-    """Advance simulated positions using completed EOD bars and write state idempotently."""
+    """Advance simulated positions using completed EOD bars and write state idempotently.
+
+    Two distinct lookups are needed and must not be conflated:
+
+    ``bar_map``
+        Completed OHLC for *every* observed symbol, used to advance an existing
+        watchlist entry or open position.  ``market_rows`` is the right source
+        because a held symbol may drop out of today's qualified candidates and
